1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
Hi! Check out my first ZK Game: Snarks and Starks United.

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:02,800
The UI is still a work in progress.

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,200
This is a ZK Extrasensory Perception game.

4
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,600
You and your friends can have fun playing against each other.

5
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:07,000
Here's how it works:

6
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,800
John has loaded the app and will create an account.

7
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:13,867
The onboarding is easy and clean for users (no private keys or seed phrases).

8
00:00:13,867 --> 00:00:17,933
John just needs to press a button and set his nickname to create (and, in the background, deploy) his Starknet account.

9
00:00:17,933 --> 00:00:22,000
Then, to create a game, we copy the account address and fund the wallet.

10
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Now we set the bet amount for this game.

11
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:36,500
And choose our secret number.

12
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:57,000
Finally, we approve our entry fee to register the game and place our bet on Starknet (hashed commitment).

13
00:00:57,500 --> 00:01:02,000
Now, let's tell our friend Mike to play with us.

14
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:16,000
For onboarding, he must create his new account.

15
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:35,000
And fund his new account to join a game using John's Game ID.

16
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:55,000
Now Mike sets his own secret number and joins our game.

17
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:09,000
Now John will try to guess Mike's secret number.

18
00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:24,000
Using his paranormal powers, he believes it is 11.

19
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:45,500
Now Mike receives the guess and checks whether the number is correct.

20
00:02:58,500 --> 00:03:00,500
John failed, so now Mike will try to guess John's secret number.

21
00:03:05,500 --> 00:03:14,000
Mike believes that John's secret number is 55.

22
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:30,500
Now John receives the number, creates the proof, and sends it to the blockchain for verification.

23
00:03:41,500 --> 00:03:44,000
Bad luck for John!! Mike has stronger ESP powers.

24
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:57,000
Mike wins and claims his reward!...:)
